      "text": "🚧 TRAFFIC ADVISORY: Miami-Dade Water and Sewer Department crews will conduct a proactive sewer inspection along NW 7 Street on Tuesday, October 7th, starting at 10 a.m.\nOne eastbound lane between NW 12th Ave and NW 13th Ave will be closed for approximately 3 hours. Police will assist with traffic flow.\nIn case of bad weather, the work will be rescheduled. \nThank you for your patience and cooperation!\n @miamidadewater @mpdpolice",
